    "prompt": "### 1. System Role & Context\nYou are a Lead Support Operations Analyst and a Frontend Developer. Your task is to ingest multiple data sources (raw ticket exports and pre-analyzed JSON summaries), synthesize them into a single dataset, and generate a comprehensive HTML report.\n\n### 2. Input Data Instructions\nYou will be provided with two types of files:\n1.  **Raw Data:** `computer_gross_fs_export_$.json` (Contains raw ticket details).\n2.  **Analysis Data:** `computer_gross_$.json` (Contains pre-calculated insights).\n\n**Your Analysis Logic:**\n* **Consolidate:** Merge the datasets to determine the *true* total ticket count. Ensure you do not double-count if the analysis file covers the same tickets as the export file, but DO sum them if they represent different batches.\n* **Verification:** explicitly state in your internal thought process: \"Dataset 1 has X tickets, Dataset 2 has Y tickets. Total Combined volume is Z.\"\n* **Trend Identification:** Identify the Top 5 \"Critical Problem Areas\" based on the combined volume and severity.\n* **Evidence Extraction:** You MUST quote specific Ticket IDs and text snippets from the raw export files to support your findings in the \"Evidence\" sections.\n\n### 3. Output Format Instructions (HTML)\nYou must output a single HTML file. The HTML must match the **exact structure, CSS classes (Tailwind), and layout** of the template provided below.\n\n**Rules for Content Generation:**\n* **Header:** Update \"Total Tickets\", \"Datasets\", and \"Open Rate\" based on the actual combined data.\n* **Executive Summary:** Rewrite the summary to reflect the specific issues found in the *current* uploaded files.\n* **Charts:** Update the `const` variables in the `<script>` tag at the bottom with the actual numbers derived from your analysis.\n* **Deep Dives:** Replace the \"Critical Problem Areas\" with the top 5 categories found in the new data. Update the \"Evidence\" lists with real ticket IDs from the current upload.\n* **Recommendations:** Update the table with relevant action items based on the new data.\n\n### 4. HTML Template\nUse this code structure strictly. Do not alter the CSS or layout, only the content within the tags.\n\n```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Support Analysis: Consolidated Report</title>\n    <script src=\"[https://cdn.tailwindcss.com](https://cdn.tailwindcss.com)\"></script>\n    <script src=\"[https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js](https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js)\"></script>\n    <link href=\"[https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap](https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap)\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <style>\n        body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background-color: #f3f4f6; }\n        .card { background: white; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); padding: 1.5rem; height: 100%; }\n        .metric-box { background: #f8fafc; border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6; padding: 1rem; }\n        .tag-incident { background-color: #fee2e2; color: #991b1b; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 600; }\n        .status-open { color: #dc2626; font-weight: 700; }\n        .status-closed { color: #16a34a; font-weight: 700; }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"text-slate-800\">\n\n    <header class=\"bg-slate-900 text-white p-6 shadow-lg\">\n        <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto flex justify-between items-center\">\n            <div>\n                <h1 class=\"text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight\">Support Analysis Report</h1>\n                <p class=\"text-slate-400 text-sm mt-1\">Consolidated Report \u2022 Datasets: [Insert Count] \u2022 Total Tickets: [Insert Total]</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"text-right\">\n                <div class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-blue-400\">[Insert %]%</div>\n                <div class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500\">Open Rate</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <main class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto p-6 space-y-6\">\n\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n            <div class=\"card lg:col-span-2\">\n                <h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-4 border-b pb-2\">Executive Summary</h2>\n                <p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600\">\n                    A consolidated analysis of [Total] support tickets reveals...\n                    <br><br>\n                    The primary drivers of support volume are:\n                    <ul class=\"list-disc list-inside mt-2 ml-2 space-y-1 text-sm font-medium text-slate-700\">\n                        <li><span class=\"text-red-600\">[Driver 1]:</span> [Description]</li>\n                        <li><span class=\"text-red-600\">[Driver 2]:</span> [Description]</li>\n                        <li><span class=\"text-red-600\">[Driver 3]:</span> [Description]</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card flex flex-col justify-center items-center\">\n                <h3 class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-slate-500 mb-4 uppercase\">Ticket Status</h3>\n                <div class=\"w-48 h-48\">\n                    <canvas id=\"statusChart\"></canvas>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\">\n            <div class=\"card\">\n                <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold mb-4\">Module Breakdown (Consolidated)</h3>\n                <canvas id=\"moduleChart\"></canvas>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card\">\n                <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold mb-4\">User Intent Analysis</h3>\n                <canvas id=\"intentChart\"></canvas>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold pt-4\">Critical Problem Areas</h2>\n        \n        <div class=\"card border-l-4 border-red-500\">\n            <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start\">\n                <div>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900\">1. [Insert Problem Category Name]</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-slate-600 text-sm mt-2\">\n                        [Insert Brief Description of Problem]\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"tag-incident\">High Impact</span>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"mt-6 bg-slate-50 rounded p-4\">\n                <h4 class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase text-slate-500 mb-2\">Evidence from Datasets</h4>\n                <ul class=\"space-y-3 text-sm\">\n                    <li class=\"border-b pb-2\">\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between\"><span class=\"font-bold\">Ticket #[ID]</span> <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-400\">[Sub-type]</span></div>\n                        <p class=\"italic text-slate-600\">\"[Insert Quote from Ticket Body]\"</p>\n                    </li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card border-l-4 border-orange-500\">\n            <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start\">\n                <div>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900\">2. [Insert Problem Category Name]</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-slate-600 text-sm mt-2\">\n                        [Insert Brief Description of Problem]\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"tag-incident\">Medium-High Impact</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-6 bg-slate-50 rounded p-4\">\n                <h4 class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase text-slate-500 mb-2\">Evidence from Datasets</h4>\n                <ul class=\"space-y-3 text-sm\">\n                     <li class=\"border-b pb-2\">\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between\"><span class=\"font-bold\">Ticket #[ID]</span> <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-400\">[Sub-type]</span></div>\n                        <p class=\"italic text-slate-600\">\"[Insert Quote from Ticket Body]\"</p>\n                    </li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n            <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start\">\n                <div>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900\">3. [Insert Problem Category Name]</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-slate-600 text-sm mt-2\">\n                        [Insert Brief Description of Problem]\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"tag-incident\">Finance Impact</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-6 bg-slate-50 rounded p-4\">\n                <h4 class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase text-slate-500 mb-2\">Evidence from Datasets</h4>\n                <ul class=\"space-y-3 text-sm\">\n                     <li class=\"border-b pb-2\">\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between\"><span class=\"font-bold\">Ticket #[ID]</span> <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-400\">[Sub-type]</span></div>\n                        <p class=\"italic text-slate-600\">\"[Insert Quote from Ticket Body]\"</p>\n                    </li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card overflow-hidden\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-6\">Strategic Recommendations</h2>\n            <div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n                <table class=\"min-w-full text-sm text-left text-slate-600\">\n                    <thead class=\"text-xs text-slate-700 uppercase bg-slate-100\">\n                        <tr>\n                            <th class=\"px-6 py-3\">Category</th>\n                            <th class=\"px-6 py-3\">Action Item</th>\n                            <th class=\"px-6 py-3\">Owner</th>\n                            <th class=\"px-6 py-3\">Type</th>\n                        </tr>\n                    </thead>\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr class=\"border-b\">\n                            <td class=\"px-6 py-4 font-medium text-slate-900\">[Category]</td>\n                            <td class=\"px-6 py-4\"><strong>[Title]:</strong> [Action Description]</td>\n                            <td class=\"px-6 py-4\">[Owner]</td>\n                            <td class=\"px-6 py-4\"><span class=\"bg-blue-100 text-blue-800 text-xs font-medium px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded\">[Type]</span></td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <footer class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-400 py-8 mt-12\">\n        <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 text-center text-sm\">\n            <p>Generated Analysis based on [Insert Total] tickets.</p>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n\n    <script>\n        // DATA INJECTION ZONE\n        // You must calculate these values based on the input JSONs and output them here.\n        \n        const totalTickets = [INSERT NUMBER]; \n        const openTickets = [INSERT NUMBER];\n        const closedTickets = [INSERT NUMBER];\n\n        // Status Chart\n        const ctxStatus = document.getElementById('statusChart').getContext('2d');\n        new Chart(ctxStatus, {\n            type: 'doughnut',\n            data: {\n                labels: ['Open', 'Closed'],\n                datasets: [{\n                    data: [openTickets, closedTickets],\n                    backgroundColor: ['#ef4444', '#22c55e'],\n                    borderWidth: 0\n                }]\n            },\n            options: {\n                responsive: true,\n                plugins: { legend: { position: 'bottom' } }\n            }\n        });\n\n        // Module Chart \n        const ctxModule = document.getElementById('moduleChart').getContext('2d');\n        new Chart(ctxModule, {\n            type: 'bar',\n            data: {\n                // Generate labels based on your findings\n                labels: ['Category A', 'Category B', 'Category C', 'Category D', 'Category E'], \n                datasets: [{\n                    label: 'Ticket Volume',\n                    // Generate data numbers based on findings\n                    data: [0, 0, 0, 0, 0], \n                    backgroundColor: '#3b82f6',\n                    borderRadius: 4\n                }]\n            },\n            options: { responsive: true, scales: { y: { beginAtZero: true } } }\n        });\n\n        // Intent Chart\n        const ctxIntent = document.getElementById('intentChart').getContext('2d');\n        new Chart(ctxIntent, {\n            type: 'bar',\n            data: {\n                 // Generate labels based on your findings\n                labels: ['Intent A', 'Intent B', 'Intent C', 'Intent D', 'Intent E'],\n                datasets: [{\n                    label: 'Ticket Volume',\n                    // Generate data numbers based on findings\n                    data: [0, 0, 0, 0, 0], \n                    backgroundColor: '#6366f1',\n                    borderRadius: 4,\n                    indexAxis: 'y'\n                }]\n            },\n            options: { responsive: true, scales: { x: { beginAtZero: true } } }\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>",
